      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m also concerned about embedding the rollback logic inside the command dispatcher. However, there might be some ambiguity at the level of the command sender because the original \u0027status\u0027 is overridden with the `TIMED_OUT` status by `AudioCommandThread::sendCommand`: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/av/services/audiopolicy/service/AudioPolicyService.cpp;l\u003d2488;drc\u003dcb899108c8f94f083e50c271d3175af3fe5c0c39, so the sender will not know whether the patch creation / update was successful or not. Would it make sense to extend AudioCommand to also carry the original status?",
