      "message": "Commit 3fddffeed45be9187dfca38e00ddc2d7a01f6f4c is not on AOSP yet, so it is normal the link does not work.\n\nIt is just using a 4 second timeout here when the command is create audio patch:\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/android14-qpr3-release:frameworks/av/services/audioflinger/Threads.cpp;l\u003d728?q\u003dkConfigEventTimeoutNs",
